---
// Amazon 풍 상품 상세 페이지 — 무선 노이즈 캔슬링 헤드폰
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const title = 'AURA Pro 무선 노이즈 캔슬링 헤드폰 | 하이파이 오디오'
const description = 'AURA Pro 무선 블루투스 노이즈 캔슬링 오버이어 헤드폰. 50mm 티타늄 드라이버, 40시간 배터리, Hi-Res 오디오 인증.'

import heroImg from './images/hero-headphone.png'
import sideImg from './images/headphone-side.png'
import cushionImg from './images/ear-cushion.png'
import noiseCancelImg from './images/noise-cancellation.png'
import driverImg from './images/driver-unit.png'
import caseImg from './images/headphone-case.png'
import lifestyleImg from './images/headphone-lifestyle.png'
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --amz-dark: #131921;
        --amz-dark2: #232F3E;
        --amz-orange: #FF9900;
        --amz-yellow: #FFD814;
        --amz-yellow-hover: #F7CA00;
        --amz-blue: #007185;
        --amz-blue-hover: #C7511F;
        --amz-red: #B12704;
        --amz-green: #067D62;
        --amz-bg: #EAEDED;
        --amz-white: #FFFFFF;
        --amz-border: #DDD;
        --amz-text: #0F1111;
        --amz-text-sec: #565959;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--amz-bg);
        color: var(--amz-text);
        margin: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .amz-btn-yellow {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #FFD814, #F7CA00);
        border: 1px solid #FCD200;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--amz-text);
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: background 0.1s;
      }
      .amz-btn-yellow:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #F7CA00, #EFC800);
      }

      .amz-btn-orange {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #FFA41C, #FF8F00);
        border: 1px solid #E77600;
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--amz-text);
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: background 0.1s;
      }
      .amz-btn-orange:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #FF8F00, #E77600);
      }

      .amz-link {
        color: var(--amz-blue);
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .amz-link:hover {
        color: var(--amz-blue-hover);
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .star-filled { color: #FFA41C; }

      .thumb-btn {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        border: 2px solid transparent;
        border-radius: 4px;
        overflow: hidden;
        cursor: pointer;
        background: white;
        padding: 2px;
        transition: border-color 0.15s;
      }
      .thumb-btn:hover, .thumb-btn.active {
        border-color: var(--amz-blue);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(0,113,133,0.15);
      }
      .thumb-btn img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: contain;
      }

      .rating-bar-bg {
        background: #F0F2F2;
        border-radius: 4px;
        height: 20px;
        flex: 1;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .rating-bar-fill {
        background: var(--amz-orange);
        height: 100%;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
    </style>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- 상단 네비게이션 -->
  <header>
    <div class="bg-[var(--amz-dark)] text-white">
      <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-2 text-sm">
        <!-- 로고 -->
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0 py-1 px-2 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/></svg>
          <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">aura</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">.kr</span>
        </a>

        <!-- 배송지 -->
        <a href="#" class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-300 hover:text-white border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded px-2 py-1">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 0115 0z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">배송지</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white">서울 강남구</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- 검색바 -->
        <div class="flex-1 flex rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
          <select class="hidden md:block bg-[#F3F3F3] text-[var(--amz-text)] text-xs px-2 border-r border-gray-300 rounded-l-lg cursor-pointer">
            <option>전체</option>
            <option>전자제품</option>
            <option>헤드폰</option>
          </select>
          <input type="text" placeholder="검색어를 입력하세요" class="flex-1 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[var(--amz-text)] outline-none" />
          <button class="bg-[var(--amz-orange)] hover:bg-[#E8900A] px-4 rounded-r-lg cursor-pointer">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--amz-dark)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="m21 21-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- 우측 아이콘 -->
        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1">
          <a href="#" class="flex flex-col items-start px-2 py-1 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">안녕하세요, 로그인</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-xs">계정 및 목록 <span class="text-[8px]">▼</span></span>
          </a>
          <a href="#" class="flex flex-col items-start px-2 py-1 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded text-xs">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">반품 &</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-xs">주문내역</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <a href="#" class="flex items-end gap-1 px-2 py-1 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">
          <div class="relative">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            <span class="absolute -top-1 right-0 bg-[var(--amz-orange)] text-[var(--amz-dark)] text-xs font-bold w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">0</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold hidden md:inline">장바구니</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 하위 네비게이션 -->
    <div class="bg-[var(--amz-dark2)] text-white text-sm">
      <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto flex items-center gap-4 px-4 py-1.5 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gray-300 font-bold text-xs px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          전체 카테고리
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">오늘의 딜</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">베스트셀러</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">신규 출시</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">고객 서비스</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">전자제품</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">패션</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-xs hover:text-gray-300 px-1 py-0.5 border border-transparent hover:border-white rounded">식료품</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 브레드크럼 -->
  <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto px-4 py-2 text-xs text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">
    <a href="#" class="amz-link">전자제품</a> ›
    <a href="#" class="amz-link">헤드폰 & 이어폰</a> ›
    <a href="#" class="amz-link">오버이어 헤드폰</a> ›
    <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)]">무선 노이즈 캔슬링</span>
  </div>

  <!-- 상품 메인 영역 -->
  <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto px-4 pb-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 md:p-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_280px] gap-6 lg:gap-8">

        <!-- 좌측: 이미지 갤러리 -->
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row gap-3">
          <!-- 썸네일 목록 -->
          <div id="thumbnails" class="flex md:flex-col gap-2 overflow-x-auto md:overflow-visible">
            <button class="thumb-btn active" data-index="0"><img src={heroImg.src} alt="정면" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="1"><img src={sideImg.src} alt="측면" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="2"><img src={cushionImg.src} alt="이어쿠션" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="3"><img src={driverImg.src} alt="드라이버" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="4"><img src={noiseCancelImg.src} alt="노이즈캔슬링" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="5"><img src={caseImg.src} alt="케이스" /></button>
            <button class="thumb-btn" data-index="6"><img src={lifestyleImg.src} alt="라이프스타일" /></button>
          </div>

          <!-- 메인 이미지 -->
          <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center bg-white rounded-lg border border-[var(--amz-border)] p-4 min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[450px]">
            <img id="mainImage" src={heroImg.src} alt="AURA Pro 헤드폰" class="max-w-full max-h-[450px] object-contain" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 중앙: 상품 정보 -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-[var(--amz-text)]">
            AURA Pro 무선 블루투스 노이즈 캔슬링 오버이어 헤드폰 — 50mm 티타늄 드라이버, Hi-Res 오디오, 40시간 재생, 멀티포인트 연결, 접이식 디자인, 전용 케이스 포함 (매트 블랙)
          </h1>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <a href="#" class="amz-link text-sm">AURA 공식 스토어 방문</a>
          </div>

          <!-- 평점 -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap text-sm">
            <span class="font-medium text-[var(--amz-blue)]">4.7</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5">
              {[1,2,3,4].map(() => (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 star-filled" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" /></svg>
              ))}
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 star-filled" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" style="clip-path: inset(0 30% 0 0);"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <a href="#reviews" class="amz-link text-sm">3,847개의 평가</a>
            <span class="text-[var(--amz-border)]">|</span>
            <a href="#" class="amz-link text-sm">500+ 답변된 질문</a>
          </div>

          <div class="text-sm text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">
            지난 한 달간 <span class="font-medium text-[var(--amz-text)]">10,000+</span>건 이상 구매
          </div>

          <hr class="border-[var(--amz-border)]" />

          <!-- 가격 -->
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="text-[var(--amz-red)] text-sm font-medium">-42%</span>
              <span class="text-3xl font-light">₩189,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">
              정가: <span class="line-through">₩329,000</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">
              세금 포함. <a href="#" class="amz-link">배송비 및 수입 관세</a> 포함
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 쿠폰 -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#F0F8F0] border border-green-200 rounded-lg px-3 py-2">
            <input type="checkbox" class="accent-[var(--amz-green)] cursor-pointer" checked />
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--amz-green)] font-medium">₩10,000 쿠폰 적용</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">결제 시 자동 적용</span>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-[var(--amz-border)]" />

          <!-- 색상 선택 -->
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm mb-2"><span class="font-medium">색상:</span> 매트 블랙</div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1a1a1a] border-2 border-[var(--amz-blue)] shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(0,113,133,0.3)] cursor-pointer" title="매트 블랙"></button>
              <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#C0C0C0] border-2 border-transparent hover:border-[var(--amz-blue)] cursor-pointer" title="실버"></button>
              <button class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B3A5C] border-2 border-transparent hover:border-[var(--amz-blue)] cursor-pointer" title="미드나잇 블루"></button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-[var(--amz-border)]" />

          <!-- 주요 특징 (About this item) -->
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2">이 상품에 대하여</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--amz-text)]">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>업계 최고 수준의 노이즈 캔슬링:</strong> 듀얼 피드백 마이크와 AI 기반 적응형 노이즈 캔슬링 기술로 주변 소음을 최대 98% 차단합니다.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>50mm 커스텀 티타늄 드라이버:</strong> Hi-Res 오디오 인증을 받은 프리미엄 드라이버로 20Hz~40kHz의 넓은 주파수 대역을 재생합니다.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>40시간 연속 재생:</strong> 노이즈 캔슬링 활성화 상태에서도 40시간 사용 가능. 10분 급속 충전으로 5시간 재생.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>멀티포인트 블루투스 5.3:</strong> 노트북과 스마트폰을 동시에 연결하여 자유롭게 전환. LDAC & aptX Adaptive 코덱 지원.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>프리미엄 착용감:</strong> 메모리 폼 이어쿠션과 경량 티타늄 헤드밴드로 장시간 착용해도 편안합니다. 무게 단 250g.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-[var(--amz-text)] mt-1 shrink-0">•</span>
                <span><strong>구성품:</strong> AURA Pro 헤드폰, 전용 하드 케이스, USB-C 충전 케이블, 3.5mm 오디오 케이블, 항공기 어댑터, 퀵 스타트 가이드.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 우측: 구매 박스 (Buy Box) -->
        <div class="border border-[var(--amz-border)] rounded-lg p-4 space-y-3 h-fit lg:sticky lg:top-4">
          <div class="text-3xl font-light">₩189,000</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-[var(--amz-text-sec)]">
            세금 포함. <a href="#" class="amz-link">배송비 및 수입 관세</a> 포함
          </div>

          <!-- 배송 정보 -->
          <div class="space-y-1 text-sm">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[var(--amz-dark)]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M8.25 18.75a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h6m-9 0H3.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V14.25m17.25 4.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-3 0m3 0a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m3 0h1.125c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H18.75m-7.5-3H4.875c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125H6m12.75 0H18.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <div>
                <span class="font-medium">무료 배송</span>
